### Phase 2: Structure Generation

Generate the markdown structure:

```markdown
# {Name} Skill

> Version: {version}
> Compiler: {compiler_version}
> Last Updated: {date}

{purpose}

## When to Activate

Use this skill when:
{triggers as bullet points}

## Core Principles

{for each principle}
### {N}. {principle.name}
{principle.description}

{principle.rationale as italicized note if present}
{end for}

---

## Workflow

{for each phase}
### Phase {N}: {phase.phase}

{phase.description}

{phase.steps as numbered list}

**Outputs:** {phase.outputs as inline list}
{end for}

---

## Patterns

{patterns as table: Name | When | Do | Why}

## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

{antipatterns as table: Anti-Pattern | Why It Fails | Instead}

---

## Quality Checklist

Before completing:

{checklist as checkbox list}

---

## Examples

{for each example}
**{example.scenario}**

{example.application}
{end for}

---

## References

{references as bullet list}
```
